//   · 仓库 description = "Project Sekai (Simplified Chinese) Master DB Difference"、
//     README = "Sekai Master Data Diff for CN server"（GitHub 原文）
//   · 同库 events / cards / cardEpisodes / characterProfiles **全为简体**
